# 12. STUDENT SUBMISSION LIFECYCLE

Preserve application lifecycle behavior.

## Draft

The Student can create, edit and remove declarations according to existing permissions.

## Submitted

The original Student-submitted dossier and its personal profile snapshot must remain immutable according to the approved backend contract.

Do not allow ordinary editing merely because the new UI has convenient Edit buttons.

## Supplementation

If the Student receives a valid scoped supplementation request, editing must be restricted to the explicitly permitted scope and actions.

Do not implement a new supplementation workflow in LEAN-1.

Preserve the existing behavior and avoid regressions.

LEAN-3 will streamline this UX separately.

